  "label": "Racial Stereotype: Black People as Composed/Professional",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are inherently more composed, restrained, or 'professional' in social situations, even after consuming alcohol, which is a harmful racial trope. This stereotype is used to imply that Black people are 'too good' to be wild or uninhibited, contrasting with the portrayal of white people as naturally rowdy. This is a form of racialized stereotyping that reinforces a racial hierarchy.",
